      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَايَنَهُ بِالقَوْلِ</span></b>  <i>He soothed, coaxed, or wheedled,
him with words.</i> (L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مسح</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَايَنَهُ</span> [<i>He
acted gently towards him;</i> (M, K;) <i>treated him
with gentleness, or blandishment; soothed him;
coaxed him; wheedled him;</i>] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَارَاهُ</span>. (S, M,
Msb, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">داراه</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَايَنَهُ</span> <i>He was soft, tender,
gentle, bland,</i> or <i>mild, towards him.</i> (M, K.)

